onstraints with `maybe_shard_with_logical` inadvertently broke XLA arithmetic fusions in `ShardMode.AUTO`. It emitted explicit`with_sharding_constraint`s, which altered FP32 calculation order and caused KL divergence to exceed the 0.03 threshold in E2E tests.\n\nThis commit strictly limits these explicit layout constraints to `ShardMode.EXPLICIT`. In `AUTO` mode, they now fall back to No-Ops, restoring optimal XLA fusions and model accuracy while preserving the explicit sharding feature.","timestamp":"2026-09-01T03:18:51Z","author":{"name":"Emma Lien","email":"emmalien@google.com"},"committer":{"name":"Emma Lien","email":"emmalien@google.com"}},"repository":{"id":607845880,"node_id":"R_kgDOJDr9-A","name":"maxtext","full_name":"AI-Hypercomputer/maxtext","private":false,"owner":{"login":"AI-Hypercomputer","id":181000646,"node_id":"O_kgDOCsnZxg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181000646?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AI-Hypercomputer","html_url":"https://github.com/AI-Hypercomputer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AI-Hypercomputer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AI-Hypercomputer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AI-Hypercomputer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AI-Hypercomputer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AI-Hypercomputer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AI-Hypercomputer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AI-Hypercomputer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AI-Hypercomputer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AI-Hypercomputer/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"html_url":"https://github.com/AI-Hypercomputer/maxtext","description":"A simple, performant, and scalable Jax LLM!","fork":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Hypercompute